[3b] Regression diagnostics...
  --- Regression diagnostics (autosomal training genes, Human liver, 5' UTR) ---
  Normality of TE (actual, log2 scale, n=11,319): skew = 0.078, excess kurtosis = 0.247, D'Agostino K^2 p = 2.56e-08, Jarque-Bera p = 1.6e-09
  Normality of residuals: skew = 0.085, excess kurtosis = 0.370, D'Agostino K^2 p = 7.1e-14, Jarque-Bera p = 1.08e-17
  Homoscedasticity (Breusch-Pagan): LM stat = 245.029, p = 6.75e-24
  Linearity (Ramsey RESET, power=3 on fitted values): F = 108.012, p = 3.43e-47
  (in each test, p < 0.05 => reject the null of normality / homoscedasticity / linearity)
  Saved: /lab/solexa_page/xueqi/analysis_codon/figures/human_UTR/co_mega_regression_diagnostics_te_histogram_human_liver_UTR.png
